@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
' purpose: how an image suite refuses a :local image built from other defs/ and packages/ content
' covers: internal/imagebuild/inputs.go
' covers: internal/imagebuild/inputs_test.go
' covers: internal/imagebuild/targets.go
' covers: internal/imagebuild/parity_test.go
' covers: internal/imagetest/imagetest.go
' covers: internal/imagetest/imagetest_test.go
'
' ── WHY (2026-11-15) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' `mise run test-images` failed TestImageClaudecode and TestImageCodex on
' `test -f /opt/proveo/subagents/_frontmatter/<harness>.<ext>`. The :local
' images dated 2026-11-14; 9ab626af moved the frontmatter to one file per
' harness on 2026-11-15 (_spec/defs/agent-definition-sharing.puml).
' test-images never builds, so the suites checked HEAD's layout against the
' previous day's image and reported it as a product failure.
' The user chose "Stamp + fail fast (Recommended)" over building inside
' test-images and over a spec-only note.
'
' ── THE STAMP ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Every fleet build (imagebuild.buildRef) passes
' `--label proveo.inputs=<InputsDigest>`.
' InputsDigest hashes the working-tree content of every git-visible file under
' defs/ and packages/: tracked and untracked, minus .gitignore, counting the
' exec bit and symlink targets. A deleted tracked file drops out of the hash.
' The offered design compared a HEAD sha through `git diff X HEAD`. The digest
' replaces it: a sha misses an uncommitted edit (the edit-lib-then-test loop),
' and it flags a dirty-tree build as stale once that tree is committed.
' A build outside a git checkout stamps nothing (InputsArgs returns nil).
' testdata/build_argv.golden normalises the value to proveo.inputs=<inputs>,
' so content edits never churn the golden.
'
' ── THE CHECK ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' imagetest.New fails the suite when Stale(image) returns a reason: a :local
' image without the label, or with a digest other than the checkout's. The
' reason ends in `mise run build <target>`.
' Published tags pass untouched: they answer to their registry, not to this
' checkout. A missing checkout or a failed inspect passes too, so the check
' never reports staleness it did not measure.
'
' ── COARSE BY DESIGN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' One digest covers both trees for every image, so an edit under defs/hermes
' marks a codex :local stale too. The option the user chose said so: "any
' defs/packages change marks the image stale".
' cmd/ and internal/ stay out, although proveo-entrypoint compiles from them:
' including them would demand a fleet rebuild after every Go edit.
' Every image built before this stamp fails once, by design.
'
' Tests: TestInputsDigestFollowsTheWorkingTreeUnderDefsAndPackages,
' TestInputsArgsStampOnlyAGitCheckout (internal/imagebuild/inputs_test.go);
' TestStaleReasonNamesTheRebuild, TestStaleLeavesPublishedImagesAlone
' (internal/imagetest/imagetest_test.go); TestGoBuildMatchesGolden.
title Stale :local image — stamp at build, refuse at test

component "InputsDigest\ndefs/ + packages/ working tree" as DIGEST <<app>>
component "mise run build <t>\nimagebuild.buildRef" as BUILD <<app>>
component "proveo/<t>:local\nLABEL proveo.inputs" as IMG <<host>>
component "imagetest.New → Stale" as NEW <<app>>
component "suite fails:\nmise run build <t>" as FAIL <<error>>
component "suite runs" as RUN <<app>>

DIGEST ARROW_MAIN BUILD : ""--label""
BUILD ARROW_MAIN IMG
IMG ARROW_MAIN NEW : ""docker image inspect""
DIGEST ARROW_MAIN NEW : this checkout
NEW ARROW_ERROR FAIL : missing or other digest
NEW ARROW_MAIN RUN : equal, or not :local

note bottom of FAIL
  A stale image fails as stale,
  never as a missing file the
  current source already ships.
end note
@enduml
